  "id": "transactional-batch",
  "description": "One timeline through the Transactional profile: a three-operation batch — a creator-supplied Decision identity, an owned cites Link from it through the @decision label, and a guarded Task update — commits at pos-43 and returns its receipt synchronously; an identical duplicate that did not wait receives the pending receipt with 202; an identical retry receives the same receipt; the same batch resubmitted under a new key fails whole with identity-taken inside a failed receipt; the incident-Link cleanup composed with a Bead deletion commits at pos-46, after the two erasures of the changefeed fixture, and its set deletion's entries do not fit in one page. Conditions are narrated, not observed. Illustrative wire example; not evidence.",
  "scope": "https://beads.example/acme/",
